# Normalise line endings in the repository: LF everywhere.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout stores CRLF inside the Git blobs, and
# service/entrypoint.sh then fails inside the Linux container with
# "set: Illegal option -" — i.e. `docker compose up` on a clean clone dies.
#
# After changing this file, renormalise once:
#   git add --renormalize .
#   git add .gitattributes
#   git commit -m "Normalise line endings (LF)"
* text=auto eol=lf

# Shell scripts and Dockerfiles must be LF even on Windows checkouts.
*.sh        text eol=lf
Dockerfile  text eol=lf
